| Deployment            | XModel + DPU       |
| Framework             | Vitis AI           |
| Model Architecture    | Residual CNN       |
| Evaluation            | PSNR / SSIM        |
| Runtime               | FPGA DPU Execution |
| Environment           | Docker             |
| Language              | Python 3.10        |

