# Software Inference

The software inference pipeline automatically:

* Loads the trained residual CNN model
* Processes degraded PNG input images
* Generates enhanced outputs
* Creates output directories automatically during execution

Input images should be placed inside:

testing_images/degraded/

Generated outputs are automatically saved inside:

output/

Software inference model:

models/best_model_arch1.pth

---

# FPGA Deployment

The repository also includes the FPGA deployment model:

models/model_b8_c128_int.xmodel

The .xmodel artifact is generated using the Vitis AI quantization and compilation workflow for FPGA-oriented DPU inference execution.

The deployment workflow supports:

* USB-based deployment
* PuTTY runtime execution
* FPGA DPU inference
* Runtime FPS evaluation
* Hardware acceleration benchmarking

Detailed FPGA deployment and setup instructions are available inside:

docs/

Use the deployment documentation files in the docs/ directory for:

* FPGA runtime setup
* USB-based model transfer
* PuTTY terminal workflow
* .xmodel deployment process
* FPGA inference execution
* Hardware runtime validation

---

# Docker Support

The repository includes a Docker-based execution environment for reproducible inference workflows.

Docker setup and software execution instructions are available in:

docs/SOFTWARE_SETUP.md

