# Project Report

A complete technical project report is included in the repository.

Project report location:

docs/final_anas_adeeb_12(2).pdf

The report includes:

* Residual CNN architecture design
* Quantization-aware training methodology
* FPGA deployment workflow
* Docker-based execution environment
* Hardware/software comparative analysis
* PSNR / SSIM evaluation
* FPGA resource utilization
* Runtime benchmarking results
* Vitis AI deployment pipeline
* DPU-based inference execution

The report documents the complete FPGA-oriented image enhancement workflow, including INT8 deployment using Vitis AI and hardware inference execution on the Xilinx ZCU104 platform.

